## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to integrate policy-driven data masking with AWS DVA components, ensure regional data residency, and preserve auditability while maintaining low latency.

## Key Concepts

- Ingestion-time masking and policy evaluation
- EU data residency, per-tenant masking rules
- Policy engine integration (OPA) with Lambda/Fargate workflows
- Immutable audit trails (S3 Object Lock, DynamoDB logs)

## Code Example

```javascript
function maskPII(record, fields) {
  const out = {...record};
  fields.forEach(f => {
    if (typeof out[f] === 'string') {
      const v = out[f];
      out[f] = v.replace(/.(?=.{4})/g, '*');
    }
  });
  return out;
}
```

